## 6. Gauge status

For every \(G\in GL(r,2)\),
\[
U\mapsto UG,\qquad W\mapsto G^{-1}W
\]
induces the common profile relabeling \(a\mapsto aG\). The moment state is permuted accordingly:
\[
A'_{aG}(T)=A_a(T),\qquad B'_{aG}(T)=B_a(T).
\]
Thus \(s\), storage, update counts, and query counts are basis-invariant. No canonical factor basis is claimed.

